{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Starlight</h2><br><strong>Infinite Shores</strong><br><br>Explore exotic exoplanets in search of alien life! Play in the role of a research drone launched by the <i>International Space Agency</i> on a mission to discover new life in the Galaxy. <br><br>Be the first to see alien civilizations, stellar phenomena, and exotic lifeforms as you survey the Galaxy. Travel on infinite procedurally generated worlds filled with alien species, plants, alien artifacts, archeological sites, and more.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/696630/extras/store-img.jpg?t=1712619081\" /><br><br><strong>Starlight Reboot</strong><br><br>Starlight is seeing a reboot. The original game Exo, is still available for purchase as an early-release title. All customers will get the Starlight update when the game is released later this year.<br><br><strong>Game Highlights</strong><br><br>* Fly through infinite procedurally generated exotic exoplanets<br>* Discover and log alien species<br>* Solve stellar alignment puzzles with an AR interface<br>* Conduct survey missions and discover archeological ruins<br>* Explore alien temples and ruins<br>* Fast-travel across planets<br>* Decode an alien language, unlocking the secrets of our origins in the Universe<br>* Craft the tools necessary to complete your mission<br>* Find energy and minerals to keep yourself in peak working condition<br><br>Available for Steamdeck, PC, and Mac. Coming to PCVR.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/696630?t=1712619081","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/696630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1712619081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/696630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1712619081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/696630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t